{"dur": 25.98, "fps": 30, "segments": [{"id": "hook", "text": "On cherche dix personnes.", "t0": 1.2, "t1": 2.603, "words": [{"w": "On", "t": 1.2}, {"w": "cherche", "t": 1.368}, {"w": "dix", "t": 1.818}, {"w": "personnes.", "t": 2.042}]}, {"id": "qui", "text": "Pas dix spectateurs. Dix ingénieurs qui dessinent vraiment du ferraillage.", "t0": 3.403, "t1": 7.948, "words": [{"w": "Pas", "t": 3.403}, {"w": "dix", "t": 3.652}, {"w": "spectateurs.", "t": 3.901}, {"w": "Dix", "t": 4.648}, {"w": "ingénieurs", "t": 4.897}, {"w": "qui", "t": 5.582}, {"w": "dessinent", "t": 5.831}, {"w": "vraiment", "t": 6.454}, {"w": "du", "t": 7.014}, {"w": "ferraillage.", "t": 7.201}]}, {"id": "quoi", "text": "Tu testes sur une poutre de ton choix. Et tu nous dis franchement ce qui ne va pas.", "t0": 8.328, "t1": 12.509, "words": [{"w": "Tu", "t": 8.328}, {"w": "testes", "t": 8.481}, {"w": "sur", "t": 8.838}, {"w": "une", "t": 9.042}, {"w": "poutre", "t": 9.245}, {"w": "de", "t": 9.602}, {"w": "ton", "t": 9.755}, {"w": "choix.", "t": 9.959}, {"w": "Et", "t": 10.265}, {"w": "tu", "t": 10.418}, {"w": "nous", "t": 10.571}, {"w": "dis", "t": 10.826}, {"w": "franchement", "t": 11.03}, {"w": "ce", "t": 11.642}, {"w": "qui", "t": 11.795}, {"w": "ne", "t": 11.999}, {"w": "va", "t": 12.152}, {"w": "pas.", "t": 12.305}]}, {"id": "gain", "text": "En échange : l'accès avant tout le monde, et une vraie influence sur l'outil.", "t0": 12.889, "t1": 17.279, "words": [{"w": "En", "t": 12.889}, {"w": "échange", "t": 13.065}, {"w": ":", "t": 13.533}, {"w": "l'accès", "t": 13.592}, {"w": "avant", "t": 14.06}, {"w": "tout", "t": 14.411}, {"w": "le", "t": 14.704}, {"w": "monde,", "t": 14.879}, {"w": "et", "t": 15.231}, {"w": "une", "t": 15.406}, {"w": "vraie", "t": 15.64}, {"w": "influence", "t": 15.991}, {"w": "sur", "t": 16.577}, {"w": "l'outil.", "t": 16.811}]}, {"id": "civrebar", "text": "Écris-nous le mot testeur, en commentaire ou en message.", "t0": 17.659, "t1": 20.858, "words": [{"w": "Écris-nous", "t"